  "releaseNotes": "New features:\n* Exposed autocomplete, formatting and script generation features previously only available in the XTB plugin\n\nImprovements:\n* Enforce encryption and certificate checks for TDS Endpoint connections\n* Stripped unnecessary information from telemetry data\n* Perform quick initial TDS Endpoint compatibility check without requiring a full connection for improved performance\n\nFixes:\n* Perform standard type conversions when extracting data from a cursor\n* Fixed compilation of IN clauses on .NET Core",
